<p>THI YEH ZEHRA S.A. KI SADAA HAAYE CHEHLUM HOGAYA.</p>

<p>LUT GAYA SAB GHAR MERA HAAYE CHEHLUM HOGAYA.</p>

<p>BAS GAYI KARBOBALA HAAYE CHEHLUM HOGAYA.</p>

<p>1. AAYI WO SHAAME GHAREEBA'N CHAA GAYA HAR SOO DHUAA'N.</p>

<p>ZALZALE ME THI ZAMEE'N AUR QOON ROTA AASMAA'N.</p>

<p>TISHNALAB PYASON KE GHAM MEIN MUZTARIB THI ALQAMA.</p>

<p>WAADA POORA KAR DIYA SHABBIR ASWS. NE JO THA KIYA.</p>

<p>2. HAAYE DASWI KO MUHARRAM KI QAYAMAT AAGAYI.</p>

<p>DARD O GHUM KI EK FIZA KARBOBALA PAR CHAA GAYI.</p>

<p>KARBALA KI DAASTA'N HAR EK KO RULWA GAYI.</p>

<p>GOONJEGI TAA HASHR DUNIYA ME YEH MATAM KI SADA.</p>

<p>3. AAYI JAB RAN SE SADA AKBAR ASWS. KI BABA LO SALAAM.</p>

<p>KARBALA KE DASHT MEIN THA ZAALIMO'N KA IZ-DEHAAM.</p>

<p>GIRTE THE RUN MEIN MUSALSAL SHAAHE DEE'N HAR EK GAAM.</p>

<p>JIS GHADI LASHE PE POHONCHE GHAM SE DIL THARRA GAYA.</p>

<p>
4. HAATHON PAR BABA KE ASGHAR ASWS. TEER KHAKAR CHAL BASA.</p>

<p>KARB KA MANZAR NA SHAH KA DEKH PAAYE AMBIYA.</p>

<p>GURBATE SHABBIR ASWS. PAR AANSOO BAHAYE KARBALA.</p>

<p>KHODKAR ASGHAR ASWS. KI TURBAT, SHIMR L.A. NE KAATA GALA.</p>

<p>5. KARBALA KE DASHT MEIN SHADI AJAB DEKHI GAYI.</p>

<p>TEEN DIN KI BHOOK AUR PYAASE BARAATI THE SABHI.</p>

<p>EK ABAA MEIN LAASH AAYI QAIME MEIN NAUSHAH KI.</p>

<p>CHAND LAMHO'N MEIN WO GHAR, SHADI KA THA MATAM SARA.</p>

<p>6. HAYE WO AUN O MOHAMMED ASWS. HAQ PE QURBAA'N HOGAYE.</p>

<p>MAA SE JO WAADA THA POORA KAR GAYE IS SHAAN SE.</p>

<p>RUQ KIYA NA SUE DARYA DONO PYARE CHAL BASE.</p>

<p>AAYE JAB LAASHE TO MAA NE, SHUKR KA SAJDA KIYA.</p>

<p>
<center><h4>Kalaam: JANAB RAZA ALI SOHAIL SAHAB.</h4></center></p>
